\f2\fs26 \'93The demon meme left the bodies of your brethren as promised, but it took Master Kleo.\'94 Solo explained to the High Elvis through a fog of tears and anguish.\
\'93It has been rumoured he gave his life for the Elvi.\'94 The High Elvis was devastated by the passing of the wisest of all the Sages. \
\'93It is true, High Elvis. He gave up his life to save you all from ignorance and fear.\'94\
\'93He will be remembered and he will be honoured.\'94\
\'93He was honoured to have served you. We would be honoured to continue his work, to battle the certainty of faith.\'94\
\'93You and Chilo will always have a home with the Elvi.\'94 \
