\f2\fs26 Kleo awoke to the vision splendid. Before him was beauty unlike anything he could have imagined, so stunning, so sublime, so\'85. \'93Oh, crap.\'94 \
\'93Coming to see dad?\'94 Jesus said. \'93He\'92s got a bit of explaining to do.\'94\
\'93You know, you really do look like Caesare Borgia.\'94\
\'93I know, it\'92s an amazing likeness. You will have to meet dear Caesare and his family, simply lovely people.\'94\
\'93That sounds really good.\'94 Kleo shook his head. 
\f4\i The entry standards are set pretty low, thought Kleo, highly amused.
